cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript and the OrganoID paper it builds on."
title: "High-throughput organoid-chip image analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Image-analysis code for a two-layer valve-based microfluidic platform that
  cultures matrix-embedded patient-derived organoids across 208 individually
  addressable chambers and resolves schedule-dependent drug responses. The
  pipeline fine-tunes the OrganoID U-Net for on-chip organoids and adds per-Z
  3-D reconstruction, greedy 3-D-IoU tracking, and a 3-D growth/viability metric
  suite, runnable on any ND2 or TIFF time-lapse Z-stack.
